        <p class="provenance-note">Composed by rule from Wikidata item <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q405">Q405</a> (composition/0.3, view/0.2, design/0.2). The lead paragraph, the section paragraphs and the section links come from Wikipedia. Pictures come from Wikimedia Commons; a W on a picture marks one from an article, not from Wikidata; a W on a value marks a statement whose only reference is a Wikipedia.</p>
